    <DataNode elementId="AT1G72970-MONOMER" textLabel="HOTHEAD" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9S746" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="600" centerY="635" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">Comparative metabolite profiling between wild type plants and the HOTHEAD mutants indicated a deficiency in oxidizing long chain &amp;omega;-hydroxyfatty acids to &amp;omega;-oxo fatty acids. The protein sequence of HOTHEAD shares similarity to long-chain fatty acid &amp;omega;-alcohol dehydrogenase from Candida species.</Comment>
